  "contentHtml": "<p>예전에 온라인 수업때 학생들 공부하라고 만들어 둔 건데 스캔본만 있어서...</p><p>기존 학습지랑 조금 다른 부분이 있을 수 있는데.. 수정해서 사용하시면 됩니다 ^^;</p><p>* pdf는 용량 부족으로 인해 jpg로 바꿔서 올립니다 ㅠㅠ&#160;</p><p>* 비상교과서 p.243 모형은 만들기 쉽지 않아서 전체활동으로는 포기하고 만들 수 있는 친구들 것만 확인했다는 뜻입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3f3c15fe83f7deecb976168dd0938d3057be17f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f3f3c15fe83f7deecb976168dd0938d3057be17f\" data-origin-width=\"1240\" data-origin-height=\"1755\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40f9d3fd86867e983c2ee098b3005998eb391c70\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40f9d3fd86867e983c2ee098b3005998eb391c70\" data-origin-width=\"1240\" data-origin-height=\"1755\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b1450a9fbc47b0078f1230939554a1dc85e31ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b1450a9fbc47b0078f1230939554a1dc85e31ee\" data-origin-width=\"1240\" data-origin-height=\"1755\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/515d756f98bdd4f590f742d65f18f5a50a77e671\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/515d756f98bdd4f590f742d65f18f5a50a77e671\" data-origin-width=\"1240\" data-origin-height=\"1755\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/880d07f06b00aea5a0c6a9757e119f77f9abca0